 "name": "H12VNT2B",
 "kind": "tvs",
 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology Co., Ltd",
 "title": "H12VNT2B: two-line bidirectional 12 V ESD protection diode, 60 pF max, SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.1",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A pair of bidirectional transient-voltage suppressors in one SOT-23, each joining one of pins 1 and 2 to the shared pin 3. Each line stands off 12 V, breaks down between 13.3 V and 16.5 V at 1 mA, and clamps to 26 V typical at 19 A of 8/20 µs surge. It withstands ±30 kV contact and air discharge to IEC 61000-4-2, with junction capacitance up to 60 pF. Listed uses are automotive electronics: CAN bus, ECUs, body, ADAS and powertrain control units.",
